# Downloaded llama-server release binary + shared libraries (staging
# prerequisite, recorded by identifier/sha256 in the README, never
# committed).
bin/

# Raw per-run measurement dumps (README is the durable record). The one
# exception is results/summary.json: a published aggregate of already-
# computed rates, percentiles, and counts (no per-prompt content) — it is
# NOT independently recomputable raw samples, only a durable record of
# numbers this probe already computed, so `bun run src/run.ts report` can
# still render the README on a fresh checkout that has none of the raw
# per-request records below.
results/*
!results/summary.json
